	{ "id": "bomb-bolt", "name": "Bomb-bolt", "kind": "item", "cost": 25, "traits": ["rare:0-1"], "text": "*Item, Rare 0-1*\n\nThis item requires the fighter to be equipped with a Crossbow.\n\nOnce per battle, this fighter can make a Ranged Attack action with the following weapon: Range 20\", Attacks 1, Rend -1, Damage d3+1, Critical Damage -, *Blast*." },
	{ "id": "grappling-hook", "name": "Grappling Hook", "kind": "item", "cost": 5, "traits": ["rare:0-2"], "text": "*Item, Rare: 0-2*\n\nThis fighter can climb high walls in the same manner as ladders." },
	{ "id": "grimoire", "name": "Grimoire", "kind": "item", "cost": 15, "text": "*Item, Rare: 0-1*\n\nOnce per battle, after this fighter has made casting roll, you can re-roll the casting roll.", "traits": ["rare:0-1"] },
	{ "id": "guild-banner", "name": "Guild Banner", "kind": "item", "cost": 25, "held": true, "traits": ["rare:0-1"], "text": "*Held Item, Rare: 0-1*\n\nWhile this fighter is on the battlefield, you can re-roll flee tests.\n\nYou can re-roll Willpower tests made by friendly fighters while they are within 12\" of this fighter and this fighter is visible to them." },
	{ "id": "lantern-torch", "name": "Lantern/Torch", "kind": "item", "cost": 4, "held": true, "text": "*Held Item*\n\nWorsen the Armour value of enemy *Demon* and *Undead* fighters by 1 while they are engaged with any fighters equipped with this item." },
	{ "id": "loyal-companion", "name": "Loyal Companion", "kind": "item", "cost": 20, "traits": ["rare:0-1"], "text": "*Item, Rare: 0-1*\n\nEach time the bearer makes a melee attack, they can make 1 additional attack with the following weapon: Rend -1, Damage 1, Critical Damage d3, *Natural Weapon*.\n\n*The Loyal Companion is not considered a separate fighter for any rules.*" },
	{ "id": "shield", "name": "Shield", "kind": "item", "cost": 10, "held": true, "effects": [{ "stat": "armour", "bonus": -1 }], "text": "*Held Item*\n\nImprove this fighter's Armour value by 1, to a maximum of 2+. (For example, 6+ becomes 5+)." },
	{ "id": "wooden-stakes", "name": "Wooden Stakes", "kind": "item", "cost": 5, "traits": ["rare:0-1"], "text": "*Item, Rare: 0-1*\n\nOnce per battle, while this fighter is engaged in melee with a *Undead* or *Demon* fighter that is bloodied, it can use the following bonus action:\n\n**Drive the Stake [Bonus Action]:** Pick an enemy *Demon* or *Undead* fighter this fighter is engaged in melee with, that is bloodied, to be the target. Roll a dice. On a 2+ the target is immediately taken down. In the aftermath of battle, this fighter earns 10 bonus experience." }
